label meeting_the_familiar:
    scene black with fade

    centered "Tomorrow at 6pm..."


    scene bg living_room

    "Come on, come on, where is he?"

    show mocha at cat_middling with dissolve:
        yoffset 100

    mocha "Meow!"

    n relief street "Sorry, Mocha, we'll play later."

    play sound "audio/sfx/doorbell.wav"

    "I check the peephole. It's him. Finally."

    n street "Come in."

    show cody casual at rightish with dissolve

    c "Hey, Nadine."

    n "Hi, Cody."

    c "Your roomie's not around, is she?"

    n "No, she said she had volunteer work."

    mocha "Mroooow."

    show cody happy with dissolve


    c "Hey there, little guy!"

    hide mocha with dissolve

    "Cody reaches toward Mocha, but Mocha walks away and sits at my feet."

    show cody annoyed with dissolve

    c "Guess he likes Mom best."

    show cody -annoyed

    c "Anyways, where's the guest of honor?"

    n "They should be calling right about..."

    play sound "<from 1.0 to 2.0>audio/sfx/21-sfx_ringtone.ogg"

    n shocked "They should be calling right about...{fast}ACK!"

    familiar "Are you there, Nadine?"

    "What do you think?"

    n sad "Yes."

    familiar "Are you in a private location? No witnesses?"

    n "Only my cat."

    familiar "The cat needs to leave."

    n deadpan "..."

    hide mocha with dissolve

    "Mocha leaves without a care."

    n "The cat left."

    "{i}Are you happy{/i}?"

    familiar "Open the window."

    n uncertain "Why?"

    familiar "Just open the window."

    show cody annoyed

    "Something feels off. Cody senses it too. He puts a hand on my shoulder."

    c "What's going to happen if we open the window?"

    familiar "I'm right outside."

    n "So why can't you come in through the door?"

    "Suddenly, Cody and I hear a tapping on the window."

    n sad "Who's there?"

    "Before I get up, Cody stops me."

    c "Hold on."

    "He pulls out a baseball bat?!"

    n shocked "Why do you have that?!"

    show cody flirty with dissolve

    c "I'm not gonna let my best friend walk into a possible death trap."

    "I walk over to the window and see a magpie."

    n relief "Okay, nothing there."

    "The magpie looks directly at me and says:"

    familiar "Can you open the window now, Miss Bunker?"

    show cody shocked

    n shocked "..."

    "I look at Cody, but he just shrugs."

    n sad "There, I opened it."

    "The magpie flies right in and perches on my couch. He looks at Cody."

    familiar "You aren't going to use that bat, are you?"

    "Cody drops the bat."

    n customerservice "Okay. Okay. I have a few questions."

    n angry "Okay. Okay. I have a few questions.{fast} WHO THE H*LL ARE YOU AND WHERE THE H*LL DID YOU COME FROM?!" with hpunch

    familiar "All you need to know is that I'm not from your world."

    n "Could have fooled me."

    familiar "I choose to ignore that. Anyways, "

    jump cody_envy


    







    

    